From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maago <maago@example.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:39:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Try a stylesheet that is not there

A mistake on purpose. base.html links board/style.css, which static/
does not have.

The name in {{static}} must be written out as it is, and maago gen
checks that the app's static/ has it. It stops before a browser gets a
404:

    board/templates/base.html:4:39: static "board/style.css": no file board/static/style.css
      fix: add it to board/static, or name one of its files

The next commit puts it back.

Maago-Expect: board/templates/base.html:4:39: static "board/style.css": no file board/static/style.css

diff --git a/board/templates/base.html b/board/templates/base.html
index 3df11d2..df2bf4c 100644
--- a/board/templates/base.html
+++ b/board/templates/base.html
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 <!doctype html>
 <html lang="ko">
 <head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>게시판</title>
-<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{static "board/tailwind.css"}}"></head>
+<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{static "board/style.css"}}"></head>
 <body class="mx-auto max-w-2xl p-4 text-gray-900">
 <header class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4 border-b pb-2"><a class="font-bold" href="{{url "home"}}">게시판</a>
 <a href="{{url "login"}}">로그인</a> <a href="{{url "signup"}}">가입</a>
